    {"claim": "The corporate-personhood precedent both speakers wave around as benign is the historical archetype of liability limitation — that's the whole point of the limited-liability corporation since the British Joint Stock Companies Act of 1856.", "targets": [], "relationship": ""},
    {"claim": "Safetyist's release-gate line collapses the moment someone fine-tunes an open-weight model on a consumer GPU — a process that costs hundreds of dollars, not millions.", "targets": [], "relationship": ""},
    {"claim": "Disclosure-of-principal is a mailing address. It is monitoring, not protection. It detects nothing where the harm is latent and diffuse.", "targets": [], "relationship": ""}
